  id: caerta_002
  titulo: DuckWiggie
  arteCarta: {fileID: 7350041905874568953, guid: bfca057ee5e4c664cb8cd8ef1f4b1f42, type: 3}
  descricao: DuckWiggie is an inexperienced artist who dreams of publishing her very
    first manga series. Do you want to invest in her career through a major publishing
    company?
  contratar:
    textoResultado: Thanks to DuckWiggie's talent, the first volume of her manga
      becomes a huge bestseller, greatly increasing the publisher's profits. However,
      the company's constant pressure for new releases causes her to burn out, forcing
      her to abandon her manga career and wasting your entire investment.
    deltaDinheiro: -200
    arteResultado: {fileID: 0}
  naoContratar:
    textoResultado: 'DuckWiggie starts small by publishing her work on a digital
      manga platform. She gradually builds a loyal fanbase whose members pay monthly
      subscriptions just to keep reading her series, generating a modest profit. '
    deltaDinheiro: 30
    arteResultado: {fileID: 0}
